      "card": "Trailblazer",
      "action": "Skill",
      "note": "Integration makes the intended traversal unambiguous: ally starts three spaces from Silverarrow and obstacle is the intervening second space on the same file, leaving its two-space endpoint empty. Original ally distance2 placed Silverarrow on the intended endpoint and allowed a detour. Original toward/distance answers and moved2 outcome preserved; traversal is now asserted.",
